#: ../../index.md:1
msgid "Language Check"
msgstr "Language Check"

#: ../../index.md:3
msgid "A fast, multi-engine prose linter for VS Code and Neovim with a Rust core."
msgstr "A fast, multi-engine prose linter for VS Code and Neovim with a Rust core."

#: ../../index.md:5
msgid "Language Check catches grammar, spelling, and style issues in Markdown, HTML, LaTeX, Typst, reStructuredText, Org mode, BibTeX, Forester, and R Sweave files using [Harper](https://github.com/elijah-potter/harper), optional [LanguageTool](https://languagetool.org/), optional [Vale](https://vale.sh/), and optional [Proselint](https://github.com/amperser/proselint) integration."
msgstr "Language Check catches grammar, spelling, and style issues in Markdown, HTML, LaTeX, Typst, reStructuredText, Org mode, BibTeX, Forester, and R Sweave files using [Harper](https://github.com/elijah-potter/harper), optional [LanguageTool](https://languagetool.org/), optional [Vale](https://vale.sh/), and optional [Proselint](https://github.com/amperser/proselint) integration."

