#: ../../index.md:22
msgid "Language Check is in active early development. Core checking is stable and usable, but you may encounter bugs — please [report them](https://github.com/KaiErikNiermann/LangCheck/issues) and they will be fixed promptly. The configuration format may change between minor versions; backwards compatibility is a goal but not yet guaranteed."
msgstr "Language Check is in active early development. Core checking is stable and usable, but you may encounter bugs — please [report them](https://github.com/KaiErikNiermann/LangCheck/issues) and they will be fixed promptly. The configuration format may change between minor versions; backwards compatibility is a goal but not yet guaranteed."
